{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "改名叫魅力远航  (Renaming the Show Charming Voyage)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting in the courtyard with the chairwoman, Bu Xiaogu explains why working alongside Chun Yuqiao only strengthened her resolve—and helps brainstorm a brighter title for his new reality show. Listen to Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "毕业之前我觉得，没有什么事比追寻自己的梦想更重要的了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "认识淳于总之后，我越发地相信我做的决定更对了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不但没有让我失望，没有让我改变主意，反而让我觉得淳于总是对的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得我是个幸运的人，以后我都会跟着淳于总，都会相信他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "因为他是给我动力、让我前行的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "孤岛这个节目什么都好，就是名字太沉重了，应该换个名字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我跟您一起想，首先它得有动感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总设计的这个理念，是逃离孤岛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得逃亡这个动词特别有游戏性，而且还有紧迫感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还得再修饰一下，叫魅力远航怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "毕业之前我觉得，没有什么事比追寻自己的梦想更重要的了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before graduation, I felt nothing mattered more than chasing my own dream.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "认识淳于总之后，我越发地相信我做的决定更对了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After getting to know Mr Chun Yuqiao, I grew even more certain I made the right choice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不但没有让我失望，没有让我改变主意，反而让我觉得淳于总是对的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Far from disappointing me or changing my mind, it convinced me Mr Chun Yuqiao is right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得我是个幸运的人，以后我都会跟着淳于总，都会相信他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I feel lucky; from here on out I will follow Mr Chun Yuqiao's lead and trust him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "因为他是给我动力、让我前行的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because he is the one who gives me drive and keeps me moving forward.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "孤岛这个节目什么都好，就是名字太沉重了，应该换个名字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything about Lonely Island is great except the title feels too heavy—we should rename it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我跟您一起想，首先它得有动感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, let us brainstorm together—first, the title needs a sense of motion.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总设计的这个理念，是逃离孤岛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The core idea Mr Chun Yuqiao designed is breaking free from an isolated island.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得逃亡这个动词特别有游戏性，而且还有紧迫感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think the verb escape feels playful like a game and carries real urgency.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还得再修饰一下，叫魅力远航怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us polish it a touch further—how about calling it Charming Voyage?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "毕业之前我觉得，没有什么事比追寻自己的梦想更重要的了。",
      "gap": 0.5
