      "t": "淳于总设计的这个理念，是逃离孤岛。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得逃亡这个动词特别有游戏性，而且还有紧迫感。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还得再修饰一下，叫魅力远航怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inspired by Bu Xiaogu's enthusiasm, the chairwoman unveils Charming Voyage that very night as Xingtian's flagship original show. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
